{
    "title": "Xpectations!\u00ae Plus",
    "description": "The convenience and value of a mobile bank account is now available in an innovative app to help Xpectations! Plus customers manage their money, access full account features and get the protection they deserve.\r\n\r\nXpect more with improved features, enhanced protection and low fees with the Xpectations! Plus Debit Card:\r\n\u2022 Free reloads at PLS when you load cash onto your Xpectations! Plus Debit Card\u00b9\r\n\u2022 No monthly fees with $500 of eligible direct deposits\u00b2\r\n\u2022 $0 Purchase Transaction Fees\u00b3\r\n\u2022 Free nationwide ATM network, including all PLS stores\u2074\r\n\u2022 Get your payroll up to 2 days early, or government benefits up to 4 days early with direct deposits\u2075\r\n\u2022 Overdraft protection up to $200 with opt-in and eligible direct deposits\u2076\r\n\u2022 Keep your money safe - lock and unlock your card\u2077, contactless chip-enabled card, receive fraud text alerts\u2078\r\n\u2022 High-yield savings account 1.00% APY, based on 0.99% interest rate up to $10,000\u2079\r\n\u2022 Transfer money from your linked debit card or bank account\u00b9\u2070\r\n\r\nVisit PLScard.com to learn more or stop into any PLS store to apply for an Xpectations! Plus Debit Card. Most stores open 24/7.\r\n\r\nOnline access and identity verification (including Social Security, TIN or select US ID type or Foreign ID types) is required for card activation and to open an account. Mobile number or email address verification and mobile app are required to access all features.\r\n1. There is no charge for cash reloads at PLS Check Cashers locations. Individual retailers other than PLS Check Cashers locations may charge a fee.\r\n2. Monthly fee waived whenever you receive payroll or government benefits direct deposits of $500 or more in the previous monthly statement period. Otherwise, $5 per month.\r\n3. There are no pay per use fees on purchase transactions when you use your Xpectations! Plus Debit Card.\r\n4. See app or website for free ATM locations. $3 for out-of-network withdrawals, plus any additional fees the ATM owner or bank may charge. Limits apply.\r\n5. Early direct deposit availability depends on payor type, timing, payment instructions, and bank fraud prevention measures. As such, early direct deposit availability may vary from pay period to pay period. The name, Social Security, TIN or select US ID type or Foreign ID type number on fi\u00adle with your employer or benefits provider must match your Xpectations! Plus Debit Card account to prevent fraud restrictions on the account.\r\n6. Up to $200 overdraft protection with opt-in and eligible direct deposits. Fees, terms & conditions apply.\r\n7. Previously authorized transactions and deposits/transfers to your account will function with a locked card.\r\n8. Message and data rates may apply.\r\n9. Interest paid quarterly on the average daily balance of savings during the quarter up to a $10,000 average daily balance and if the account is in good standing. Fees on your primary deposit account may reduce earnings on your savings account. 1.00% Annual Percentage Yield (APY) and 0.99% interest rate are accurate as of April 2024 APY and interest rate may change before or after you open an account. See Deposit Account Agreement for terms and conditions.\r\n10. Customer can transfer their funds from another debit card or bank account to their Xpectations! Plus Debit Card account in minutes for a small fee. Limits apply to bank transfers and are subject to your bank\u2019s restrictions and fees. Bank account verification services provided by Plaid. Activated, personalized debit card required to make a bank transfer. See Deposit Account Agreement for terms and conditions at PLScard.com/agreements.\r\n\r\nThe Xpectations! Plus card is issued by Green Dot Bank d/b/a GO2bank, Member FDIC, pursuant to a license by Mastercard International Inc. Mastercard and the circles design are registered trademarks of Mastercard International Incorporated.\r\n\r\n\u00a92024 PLS Financial Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\r\n\u00a92024 Green Dot Corporation. All rights reserved. Green Dot Corporation NMLS #914924; Green Dot Bank NMLS #908739.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The convenience and value of a mobile bank account is now available in an innovative app to help Xpectations! Plus customers manage their money, access full account features and get the protection they deserve.<br><br>Xpect more with improved features, enhanced protection and low fees with the Xpectations! Plus Debit Card:<br>\u2022 Free reloads at PLS when you load cash onto your Xpectations! Plus Debit Card\u00b9<br>\u2022 No monthly fees with $500 of eligible direct deposits\u00b2<br>\u2022 $0 Purchase Transaction Fees\u00b3<br>\u2022 Free nationwide ATM network, including all PLS stores\u2074<br>\u2022 Get your payroll up to 2 days early, or government benefits up to 4 days early with direct deposits\u2075<br>\u2022 Overdraft protection up to $200 with opt-in and eligible direct deposits\u2076<br>\u2022 Keep your money safe - lock and unlock your card\u2077, contactless chip-enabled card, receive fraud text alerts\u2078<br>\u2022 High-yield savings account 1.00% APY, based on 0.99% interest rate up to $10,000\u2079<br>\u2022 Transfer money from your linked debit card or bank account\u00b9\u2070<br><br>Visit PLScard.com to learn more or stop into any PLS store to apply for an Xpectations! Plus Debit Card. Most stores open 24/7.<br><br>Online access and identity verification (including Social Security, TIN or select US ID type or Foreign ID types) is required for card activation and to open an account. Mobile number or email address verification and mobile app are required to access all features.<br>1. There is no charge for cash reloads at PLS Check Cashers locations. Individual retailers other than PLS Check Cashers locations may charge a fee.<br>2. Monthly fee waived whenever you receive payroll or government benefits direct deposits of $500 or more in the previous monthly statement period. Otherwise, $5 per month.<br>3. There are no pay per use fees on purchase transactions when you use your Xpectations! Plus Debit Card.<br>4. See app or website for free ATM locations. $3 for out-of-network withdrawals, plus any additional fees the ATM owner or bank may charge. Limits apply.<br>5. Early direct deposit availability depends on payor type, timing, payment instructions, and bank fraud prevention measures. As such, early direct deposit availability may vary from pay period to pay period. The name, Social Security, TIN or select US ID type or Foreign ID type number on fi\u00adle with your employer or benefits provider must match your Xpectations! Plus Debit Card account to prevent fraud restrictions on the account.<br>6. Up to $200 overdraft protection with opt-in and eligible direct deposits. Fees, terms &amp; conditions apply.<br>7. Previously authorized transactions and deposits/transfers to your account will function with a locked card.<br>8. Message and data rates may apply.<br>9. Interest paid quarterly on the average daily balance of savings during the quarter up to a $10,000 average daily balance and if the account is in good standing. Fees on your primary deposit account may reduce earnings on your savings account. 1.00% Annual Percentage Yield (APY) and 0.99% interest rate are accurate as of April 2024 APY and interest rate may change before or after you open an account. See Deposit Account Agreement for terms and conditions.<br>10. Customer can transfer their funds from another debit card or bank account to their Xpectations! Plus Debit Card account in minutes for a small fee. Limits apply to bank transfers and are subject to your bank\u2019s restrictions and fees. Bank account verification services provided by Plaid. Activated, personalized debit card required to make a bank transfer. See Deposit Account Agreement for terms and conditions at PLScard.com/agreements.<br><br>The Xpectations! Plus card is issued by Green Dot Bank d/b/a GO2bank, Member FDIC, pursuant to a license by Mastercard International Inc. Mastercard and the circles design are registered trademarks of Mastercard International Incorporated.<br><br>\u00a92024 PLS Financial Services, Inc. All rights reserved.<br>\u00a92024 Green Dot Corporation. All rights reserved. Green Dot Corporation NMLS #914924; Green Dot Bank NMLS #908739.",
